    "html": "<p>The induced emf <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\mathcal{E}\"></span> in a rotating coil of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"N\"></span> turns and area <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"A\"></span> in a uniform magnetic field <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B\"></span> is given by <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\mathcal{E} = NBA\\omega\\sin(\\omega t)\"></span>. What is the effect of doubling the frequency of rotation?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\mathcal{E}_\\text{max}\"></span> is halved</p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\mathcal{E}_\\text{max}\"></span> is unchanged</p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\mathcal{E}_\\text{max}\"></span> is doubled</p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\mathcal{E}_\\text{max}\"></span> is quadrupled</p></li></ol>"
